DESCRIPTION:AFTER TERM ENDS: included because it is a required assessment a
 rising from this term. Personally complete the IPAC ratings and feedback f
 or your teammates and yourself. The explicit assessment deadline is 14:00 
 on 23 December\; a later closing date inside IPAC allows late submission a
 nd does not replace this deadline. Weekly minutes are part of this compone
 nt: the team should submit at least six records\, aiming for within 48 hou
 rs of each on-campus team meeting.\n\nCertainty: Published\nUK time (Europ
 e/London\, GMT).\nSnapshot: 23 November 2026\; not automatically updated.\
